diff --git a/docs/notes/handoff-ack.md b/docs/notes/handoff-ack.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..805f504
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/notes/handoff-ack.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Sidebar handoff and host integration
+
+This patch waits for the gateway response before recording a successful handoff. Pending, rejected and queued decisions keep distinct feedback and retry behavior. Request identity is checked before dispatch, duplicate clicks are suppressed, and late responses cannot replace a newer card. The Windows panel host validates fresh leases and the process/window identity before attaching the sidebar panel. Other platforms retain the ordinary Pinky panel behavior.
+
+## Checks
+
+Against the pinned Pinky 19 source, the Windows client build and vet passed. The targeted UI and locale packages passed. The full package suite was not run for this exported patch. A separate desktop integration run attached the live panel in the hidden idle state at 360×80 with matching lease identity and zero phone actions. The detail view and real handoff button callback remain unverified; phone testing is paused until tomorrow.
\ No newline at end of file
